      "description": "A derogatory slang term used to demean people who are perceived as overly sensitive, politically correct, or easily offended, often implying they are weak or emotionally fragile. This term is used in the meme to dismiss individuals seeking 'safe spaces' and to frame them as unwelcome or fragile.",
