      "instance_name": "dismissive_contempt",
      "label": "dismissive contempt expression",
      "description": "Tom Hardy's stern, slightly turned-away facial expression, combined with his unsmiling, aloof gaze, conveys a clear sense of disdain and rejection. His facial features—tight lips, narrowed eyes, and rigid posture—visually communicate contempt for the idea of 'safe spaces' and for those perceived as easily offended, aligning with the textual message.",
