      "description": "The meme uses derogatory language ('snowflake') to demean individuals perceived as overly sensitive or easily offended, framing them as weak and unwelcome. This targets people based on their perceived emotional or social behavior, which is a protected characteristic, and promotes exclusionary and hostile attitudes.",
