      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The target community is individuals who are perceived as overly sensitive, easily offended, or politically correct, often referred to derogatorily as 'snowflakes'. The meme is designed to appeal to those who hold a dismissive or hostile attitude toward such individuals, framing them as weak or unwelcome in spaces that do not tolerate sensitivity. The use of Tom Hardy’s stern, authoritative image reinforces this message, targeting those who identify with or support exclusionary, confrontational attitudes toward people seeking 'safe spaces'.",
